#: model:ir.model.fields,help:edi_exchange_deduplicate_oca.field_edi_exchange_type__deduplicate_on_exchange
msgid ""
"When an exchange record is created, mark the older ones for the same record "
"that are still pending as obsolete, so only the freshest one is sent or "
"processed. Records without a related record match on the exchange type "
"alone, which suits full-dump payloads where only the latest one matters."
msgstr ""

